[{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0004","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0004.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-32781","title":"Apollo Portal 配置中心未授权访问漏洞","description":"Apollo 配置中心 Portal 在 2.5.0 版本之前存在未授权访问漏洞。当目标环境启用了 configView.memberOnly.envs 配置时，低权限认证用户可直接向 /envs/{env}/releases/{releaseId} 接口发送请求，通过构造有效的 release ID 绕过权限校验，获取其未被授权的应用或命名空间的配置发布数据。该接口未调用 UserPermissionValidator.shouldHideConfigToCurrentUser 进行权限检查，导致敏感配置信息泄露。攻击者需拥有 Portal 的低权限账号并知晓目标 release ID，攻击门槛较低。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":6.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-32781","GHSA-jxpj-9j24-w337"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2026-07-12","updated":"2026-07-13","remediation":"升级 Apollo Portal 至 2.5.0 或更高版本，该版本已修复未授权访问问题。修复提交为 apolloconfig/apollo@362735d，对应 PR #5378。如无法立即升级，可启用 configView.memberOnly.envs 配置并严格限制环境访问权限，同时在网关或反向代理层对 GET /envs/{env}/releases/{releaseId} 接口添加额外的身份校验中间件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/security/advisories/GHSA-jxpj-9j24-w337","https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/pull/5378","https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/commit/362735ded4f13b62f6ab9df135d7096066e8e291","https://github.com/apolloconfig/apollo/releases/tag/v2.5.0"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0004.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0001","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0001.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-45422","title":"Proximus b-box 路由器 UPnP 访问控制不当漏洞","description":"Proximus b-box 路由器 UPnP 功能存在访问控制不当漏洞（CWE-284）。已获得路由器管理权限的攻击者可利用该缺陷绕过正常的访问限制机制，未经授权直接修改端口转发规则，导致内部网络服务被意外暴露至公网，增加被远程攻击的风险。该漏洞影响 Proximus b-box v8c.725A 版本，CVSS 评分 8.1，危害等级高。建议用户及时关注厂商固件更新以修复此漏洞。","severity":"HIGH","score":8.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-45422"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-09T21:16:54.167","updated":"2026-07-10T18:53:55.130","remediation":"建议立即登录 Proximus b-box 路由器管理后台（通常为 192.168.1.1），在「维护」或「系统」页面检查固件更新，将固件升级至 v8c.725A 及以后修复版本。如厂商尚未发布补丁，可在「高级设置」中关闭 UPnP 服务（取消勾选「启用 UPnP」），并限制管理界面仅允许内网 IP 地址访问，以防止攻击者从外部网络利用该漏洞修改端口转发规则。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["http://b-box.com","http://proximus.com","https://github.com/Cedrico03/CVE-2025-45422---Bbox","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln-metrics/cvss/v3-calculator?vector=AV:L/AC:L/PR:N/UI:N/S:C/C:H/I:H/A:H/E:H/RL:U/RC:C/CR:H/IR:H/AR:H/MAV:N/MAC:L/MPR:N/MUI:N/MS:C/MC:H/MI:H/MA:H&version=3.1"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0001.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0001.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0002","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0002.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-58151","title":"Xapi varstored 条件竞争漏洞","description":"varstored 是 Xapi 工具栈中处理虚拟机 UEFI 变量的核心组件，其与虚拟机内部的 OVMF 通过共享缓冲区进行通信。由于缺少足够的编译器内存屏障，共享缓冲区中的数据存在 TOCTOU（时间检查与使用时间）竞态条件漏洞，攻击者可通过提前修改共享缓冲区内容来操控跳转表中的索引，可能导致任意代码执行或信息泄露。该漏洞影响使用 Xapi 工具栈的虚拟化平台，CVSS 评分 9.4，危害等级严重。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-58151"],"sources":["cnnvd"],"published":"2026-07-09T16:16:33.817","updated":"2026-07-09T17:16:56.770","remediation":"升级 varstored 到包含 CVE-2025-58151 修复的版本，具体可通过更新 Xapi toolstack 至最新补丁版（关注 XenServer/XCP-ng 厂商安全公告）。如无法立即升级，可在 VM 配置中禁用 UEFI 启动并切换为 BIOS 模式作为临时缓解措施，或限制对受影响 VM 的管理操作并发数以降低竞争窗口命中概率。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-13T00:00:00Z","references":["https://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-478.html","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2026/01/27/2","http://xenbits.xen.org/xsa/advisory-478.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0002.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0013","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0013.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-22741","title":"RiceTheme Felan Framework 反射型跨站脚本漏洞","description":"WordPress Felan Framework 插件（由 RiceTheme 开发）1.1.3 及之前版本中存在反射型跨站脚本（XSS）漏洞。该漏洞源于程序对用户输入参数在生成 Web 页面时未进行充分的中和过滤，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可通过向目标用户发送特制 URL，诱使用户点击后导致恶意脚本在用户浏览器中执行，造成敏感信息泄露、会话劫持等危害。CVSS 评分 7.1，危害等级高，攻击复杂度低，无需用户特权即可利用。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.1,"aliases":["CVE-2025-22741"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2026-05-27T09:16:26.977","updated":"2026-06-17T08:49:42.513","remediation":"立即联系 RiceTheme 获取修复版本，或确认是否有 1.1.3 以上更新。如无法升级，部署 Web 应用防火墙（如 Wordfence、Patchstack）拦截反射型 XSS 攻击流量；同时在 WordPress 配置中添加 `Content-Security-Policy` 响应头限制脚本来源作为临时缓解措施。也可考虑暂时禁用 Felan Framework 插件直至官方补丁发布。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://patchstack.com/database/wordpress/plugin/felan-framework/vulnerability/wordpress-felan-framework-plugin-1-1-3-reflected-cross-site-scripting-xss-vulnerability?_s_id=cve","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/7481e97cf7b60a5b982d99d7dad1ea61174940fb/cves/2025/22xxx/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://github.com/topscoder/nuclei-wordfence-cve/blob/a47e10c73e8cfa90d75f3b72e70fb0d1cf7c5530/nuclei-templates/2025/CVE-2025-22741-felan_framework-3be71ddf-bb6f-492f-8d89-d0d850b27233.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/94ba69fdac5ced9eb8795ce09aa042cbb168d31b/2025/22xxx/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://github.com/zzzteph/low-hanging-vulns/blob/e01cbd1436b3805fae6aac0fdbaa88371dfa18db/nvd/2025/HIGH/CVE-2025-22741/README.md","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/4e58fc35977c7899e2fc4be00dae1c243ec507c4/content/posts/cve-2025-22741.md","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/1fe9b156eeeb72b8f8baa50bbe7bc0d9806e8c64/content/CVE-2025-22741.md","https://github.com/adysec/hwpoc/blob/e2c3d33b7e2870449a687c9b1cfa4c48990c946b/docs/2026/WordPress_Felan_Framework_%E6%8F%92%E4%BB%B6%E5%8F%8D%E5%B0%84%E5%9E%8B_XSS_%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E_CVE-2025-22741.toml","https://github.com/adampielak/nuclei-templates/blob/a2f3ff3fa5db5c7705ebd942909ec114df063700/nuclei-v3/C/CVE-2025-22741-felan_framework-3be71ddf-bb6f-492f-8d89-d0d850b27233.yaml","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/bc48b6c04c59ceff2d71da45cd843fc1d449dc48/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://github.com/fkie-cad/nvd-json-data-feeds/blob/3508ccc52a2baed6a1946843005e8957c7067f39/CVE-2025/CVE-2025-227xx/CVE-2025-22741.json","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-22741"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0013.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0353","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-12659","title":"Siemens Simcenter Femap 基于堆的缓冲区溢出远程代码执行漏洞","description":"西门子 Simcenter Femap 在解析特制 IPT 文件时存在基于堆的缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-122），攻击者可通过向目标用户发送恶意构造的 IPT 文件触发内存损坏，导致在当前进程上下文中执行任意代码。该漏洞影响 Simcenter Femap 多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.3，危害等级高危。建议用户及时更新至厂商发布的安全版本。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-12659"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-05-12T14:16:49.460","updated":"2026-06-17T08:32:45.497","remediation":"立即将 Siemens Simcenter Femap 升级至 V2512.0003 或更高版本，可从 Siemens 支持门户 (support.sw.siemens.com) 获取。如暂时无法升级，切勿打开来源不明的 IPT 文件，并遵循 Siemens Industrial Security 操作指南加强系统防护。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-870926.html","https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/develop/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-134-05.json","https://www.cisa.gov/news-events/ics-advisories/icsa-26-134-05","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/TMA84/cvealert/blob/57037e9ca1e585082424bbd15c12a674807d0c21/content/posts/cve-2025-12659.md","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/c82f217443f5e10c0c4e9bda1118e45073d229ba/2025/12xxx/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-12659.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/05/GHSA-8qfq-8cwv-5jpc/GHSA-8qfq-8cwv-5jpc.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/61756b9c4d4c30577cc003b0b28e3db71ca30a1e/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/icsadvprj/ICS-Advisory-Project/blob/49f0ea1611216d6891a0af73be95062138f0615b/ICS-CERT_ADV/CISA_ICS_ADV_2026_7_21_26.csv","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/f9f61f0882f53057e94aea140828cc5fcfb545d0/advisories/2026/ZDI-26-316.json","https://github.com/anchore/nvd-data-overrides/blob/4b8ac955bad6aa0d3b908ba92904a2bb4e3a4d85/data/2025/CVE-2025-12659.json","https://github.com/cisagov/CSAF/blob/92c3e620516775934c29e13374713abb0bb85fcb/csaf_files/OT/white/2026/icsa-26-134-05.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0354","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0354.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-13957","title":"施耐德电气 EcoStruxure Data Center Expert 硬编码凭据远程代码执行漏洞","description":"施耐德电气 EcoStruxure Data Center Expert（原 StruxureWare Data Center Expert）v9.0 及之前版本中存在硬编码凭据漏洞（CWE-798）。当 SOCKS 代理功能启用时，攻击者在已知管理员凭据和 PostgreSQL 数据库凭据的情况下，可通过网络利用该漏洞实现信息泄露和远程代码执行。SOCKS 代理默认处于禁用状态，但一旦开启将带来严重安全风险。该漏洞 CVSS v4.0 评分为 7.5，危害等级较高，可导致敏感数据泄露、系统完整性破坏及关键业务中断。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-13957"],"sources":["zdi","cve"],"published":"2026-03-10","updated":"2026-06-17","remediation":"建议用户立即升级 EcoStruxure Data Center Expert 至 SEVD-2026-069-05 安全公告中指定的修复版本。如无需使用 SOCKS 代理功能，应确保其保持默认禁用状态。同时应限制对管理界面的网络访问，仅允许受信任 IP 连接，并定期更换管理员及数据库凭据。具体补丁文件请从施耐德电气官网下载中心获取。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://download.schneider-electric.com/files?p_Doc_Ref=SEVD-2026-069-05&p_enDocType=Security+and+Safety+Notice&p_File_Name=SEVD-2026-069-05.pdf","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-13957","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/56b9e9b42ce0a91a448094549973b81cdf8e832e/cves/2025/13xxx/CVE-2025-13957.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/03/GHSA-65x8-8358-vgrj/GHSA-65x8-8358-vgrj.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0354.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0358","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0358.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-14235","title":"佳能 imageCLASS 等多款打印机 TTF 解析越界写入远程代码执行漏洞","description":"佳能激光打印机和小型办公多功能一体机在处理 XPS 字体 fpgm 数据时存在缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-787），该漏洞源于对特制 XPS 文档中字体程序（fpgm）数据长度校验不充分，导致越界写入。网络相邻的攻击者无需身份认证即可向受影响设备发送特制的打印作业或 XPS 文件触发该漏洞，成功利用可导致设备拒绝服务或远程代码执行。该漏洞影响佳能日本、美国、欧洲市场多个系列打印机固件 v06.02 及更早版本，CVSS 4.0 评分 9.3，危害等级严重。该漏洞在 Pwn2Own 大赛中被公开披露，厂商已发布安全公告 CP2026-001 并提供固件更新修复。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":9.3,"aliases":["CVE-2025-14235"],"sources":["zdi"],"published":"2026-01-16T00:16:27.933","updated":"2026-06-17T08:35:35.277","remediation":"立即将受影响设备（Satera LBP670C/MF750C系列、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C系列、imageCLASS LBP230系列/MF450系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C系列等）的固件升级至 v06.02 之后的版本。请访问 https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/ 或 https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response 下载对应型号的最新固件。在无法立即升级的情况下，建议在网络层面限制打印机仅对受信任的管理端开放打印服务端口，并将打印机部署在独立 VLAN 中，避免与不受信网络直接连通。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-27T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/bb04e7276eb5376f975ca811b9a340d0d55b901d/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14235.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/59adead62d41f907bd4d8297210669925a30