或更高版本。具体型号包括：Satera LBP670C/MF750C 系列、Color imageCLASS LBP630C/MF650C 系列、imageCLASS LBP230/MF450 系列、i-SENSYS LBP630C/MF650C 系列等（完整列表见 Canon 安全公告 CP2026-001）。如无法立即升级，可在网络防火墙或交换机 ACL 中限制对打印机 TCP 端口 9013（CADM 服务）的访问，仅允许受信任的管理主机连接，作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://canon.jp/support/support-info/260115vulnerability-response","https://psirt.canon/advisory-information/cp2026-001/","https://www.canon-europe.com/support/product-security/","https://www.usa.canon.com/support/canon-product-advisories/Service-Notice-Regarding-Remediation-Measure-Against-Potential-Buffer-Overflow-Vulnerability-in-Laser-Printers-and-Small-Office-Multifunctional-Printers","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/86060d5336eceede57f01ccb65fb3037638af8db/cves/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14234.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/2726c8e981acc1c694a4bf2f24fcc9360825f783/2025/14xxx/CVE-2025-14234.json","https://github.com/3kz2501/3kz_blog/blob/9af3dcd2665eeef037166cc1ef8ef57112eebb3a/app/routes/posts/2026-01-16_CVE-2025-14234.mdx","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-14234.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/1684cfa32e43376c48beb06819bce86de6ba421b/advisories/unreviewed/2026/01/GHSA-jh9g-9h7m-5j4j/GHSA-jh9g-9h7m-5j4j.json","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/1b84eedba993546f37a880c6d2d084176a1f04a7/SSVC/data/2025/CVE-2025-14234.json","https://github.com/xhls008/nvd_yesterday/blob/67b5579a0905226d1df11dd602ae7fa1e4ed04d3/CVEs_log/2026-01-17_en.md","https://github.com/mrhenrike/PrinterXPL-Forge/blob/14c2b448afe36924e033ea4d211b90a81e1b3f30/xpl/research/research-canon-xps-bof-2025b/exploit.py","https://github.com/wooluo/vuln_crawler/blob/87dd30aa48db35ba8d8b4a33772213f42a64ff82/vulnerability_reports/vulnerability_report_2026-01-17_09-27-13.md","https://github.com/delikely/ZDI_Advisories/blob/f9f61f0882f53057e94aea140828cc5fcfb5