aliases":["CVE-2025-37164"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-12-16T17:16:07.843","updated":"2026-06-17T09:15:17.283","remediation":"立即将 HPE OneView 升级至 11.00 或更高版本。如无法立即升级，可在管理界面限制对 OneView 管理端口的网络访问，仅允许受信任的管理员 IP 连接，并在防火墙层面阻断非必要的 443/8443 端口外部访问作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/docDisplay?docId=hpesbgn04985en_us&docLocale=en_US","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/master/modules/exploits/linux/http/hpe_oneview_rce.rb","https://support.hpe.com/hpesc/public/docDisplay?docId=hpesbgn04985en_us&docLocale=en_US#vulnerability-summary-1","https://www.cisa.gov/known-exploited-vulnerabilities-catalog?field_cve=CVE-2025-37164","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/main/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-37164.yaml","https://github.com/g0vguy/CVE-2025-37164-PoC","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/f8a21b0c30953d5926478bb080c200645e84a23a/2025/CVE-2025-37164.json","https://github.com/projectdiscovery/nuclei-templates/blob/010b0aa4fab18a47a1dfa699acc027ecfea23b55/http/cves/2025/CVE-2025-37164.yaml","https://github.com/rapid7/metasploit-framework/blob/fcd24bcde44c83907fc2e965d2d0edd0cb92051b/modules/exploits/linux/http/hpe_oneview_rce.rb","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/0f1885b9ad0c36bab067e4e3d61739350d154cdf/data/by-cve/CVE-2025-37164.md","https://github.com/gelusus/wxvl/blob/0190a57b50c784bda47a3b9ac049eaf5bb577d6e/doc/2026-01/%E3%80%90%E5%9C%A8%E9%87%8E%E5%88%A9%E7%94%A8%E3%80%91HPE%20OneView%20%E8%BF%9C%E7%A8%8B%E4%BB%A3%E7%A0%81%E6%89%A7%E8%A1%8C%E6%BC%8F%E6%B4%9E(CVE-2025-37164).md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/aaa966adf56b88bf2eba7f47ee24a777c6208719/2025/CVE-2025-37164/README.md","https://github.com/ARPSyndicate/suricata-vedas/blob/fe24794ad36564b5bbc7c69101525011387b8650/2025/CVE-2025-37164.rules","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/712a40967986b700313860b08048435be4fa9839/cves/2025/37xxx/CVE-2025-37164.json","https://github.com/lianqingsec/NucleiPocGather/blob/dcce204f62196117b9c95c52d8101ccf7a5d27bc/poc/cve/CVE-2025-37164_2.yaml","https://github.com/g0vguy/CVE-2025-37164-PoC/blob/41cc3143397bd0426f3b8971700476779ecb64ab/CVE-2025-37164.py","https://github.com/rxerium/CVE-2025-37164","https://github.com/LACHHAB-Anas/Exploit_CVE-2025-37164","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2025-37164"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0088.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0088.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0088.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0352","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-67726","title":"Tornado Multipart 参数解析二次方拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Tornado 是一个 Python Web 框架和异步网络库，其 `httputil.py` 中的 `_parseparam` 函数在解析 `multipart/form-data` 等 HTTP 头部参数时使用了低效算法，在处理包含引号分号（如 `param=\";\"`）的参数时会在嵌套循环中反复调用 `string.count()`。攻击者可通过向 `Content-Disposition` 头部发送大量恶意构造的参数，使服务器 CPU 使用率呈二次方增长（O(n²)），导致拒绝服务。由于 Tornado 采用单事件循环架构，单个恶意请求即可使整个服务器长时间无响应。该漏洞影响 Tornado 6.5.2 及以下版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。官方已在 6.5.3 版本中修复。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-67726","GHSA-jhmp-mqwm-3gq8"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-12-12T07:15:44.920","updated":"2026-06-17T09:58:02.440","remediation":"立即将 Tornado 升级至 6.5.3 或更高版本（pip install --upgrade tornado），该版本已修复 `_parseparam` 函数在解析 multipart 参数时的 O(n²) 性能问题。如无法立即升级，可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）限制 `Content-Disposition` 头部的参数数量，或对上传请求进行速率限制作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/771472cfdaeebc0d89a9cc46e249f8891a6b29cd","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/releases/tag/v6.5.3","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/security/advisories/GHSA-jhmp-mqwm-3gq8","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/e530031405e2154654dedc4c84d5656b557ea310/docs/releases/v6.5.3.rst","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/tornado/CVE-2025-67726.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-67726","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/1a52ff8ec1bcb2a7098656810eca5dcfa9f4ec17/community/py3-tornado/APKBUILD","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-67726.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-67726.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-python/recipes-devtools/python/python3-tornado/CVE-2025-67726.patch"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0352.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/exploits/2025/EXP-AVE-2025-0352.toml"],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":true,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0351","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-67725","title":"Tornado HTTPHeader 合并二次复杂度拒绝服务漏洞","description":"Tornado 是一个 Python Web 框架和异步网络库，其 `HTTPHeaders.add` 方法在处理同一请求头名称重复时通过字符串拼接累积值。由于 Python 字符串不可变性，每次拼接都复制整个字符串，导致时间复杂度达 O(n²)。攻击者可利用 Tornado 单事件循环架构，构造包含大量重复头部的恶意 HTTP 请求，长期阻塞服务端事件循环，造成拒绝服务（DoS）。该漏洞影响 Tornado 6.5.2 及更早版本，CVSS 评分 7.5，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.5,"aliases":["CVE-2025-67725","GHSA-c98p-7wgm-6p64"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-12-12T06:15:41.380","updated":"2026-06-17T09:58:02.337","remediation":"升级 Tornado 至 6.5.3 或更高版本（`pip install 'tornado>=6.5.3'`）。如无法立即升级，保持 `max_header_size` 为默认值 64KB 可有效限制攻击面，同时可在反向代理层（如 Nginx）限制请求头大小作为额外缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/771472cfdaeebc0d89a9cc46e249f8891a6b29cd","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/releases/tag/v6.5.3","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/security/advisories/GHSA-c98p-7wgm-6p64","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/e530031405e2154654dedc4c84d5656b557ea310/docs/releases/v6.5.3.rst","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/tornado/CVE-2025-67725.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-67725","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/6d175f59444084675ba336cc9e2bc51fc5338e6d/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/1a52ff8ec1bcb2a7098656810eca5dcfa9f4ec17/community/py3-tornado/APKBUILD","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2025-67725.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-67725.json","https://github.com/home-assistant/buildroot/blob/dfa1d775aa4f26502c4214516050117192aeff12/package/python-tornado/python-tornado.mk"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0350","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-67724","title":"Tornado HTTP 响应标头注入与跨站脚本漏洞","description":"Tornado Python Web 框架的 `set_status` 方法与 `HTTPError` 类在处理 `reason` 参数时存在输入验证缺陷。当应用程序将不可信数据作为 `reason` 参数传递时，该参数未经过转义处理即被直接写入 HTTP 响应头或默认错误页面的 HTML 中，攻击者可利用此漏洞实现 HTTP 响应头注入或跨站脚本攻击（XSS）。该漏洞影响 Tornado 6.5.2 及之前版本，CVSS 评分 5.4（中危），厂商已发布 6.5.3 版本修复此问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.4,"aliases":["CVE-2025-67724","GHSA-pr2v-jx2c-wg9f"],"sources":["ghsa"],"published":"2025-12-12T06:15:41.213","updated":"2026-06-17T09:58:02.230","remediation":"建议立即将 Tornado 升级至 6.5.3 或更高版本，该版本已对 `reason` 参数进行转义处理，防止未转义数据被注入 HTTP 响应头或默认错误页面导致 XSS 攻击。如无法升级，应避免将任何不可信用户输入直接传入 `RequestHandler.set_status()` 或 `tornado.web.HTTPError` 的 `reason` 参数，或对输入进行严格的 HTML 实体编码和换行符过滤。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/commit/9c163aebeaad9e6e7d28bac1f33580eb00b0e421","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/releases/tag/v6.5.3","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/security/advisories/GHSA-pr2v-jx2c-wg9f","https://github.com/tornadoweb/tornado/blob/e530031405e2154654dedc4c84d5656b557ea310/docs/releases/v6.5.3.rst","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/4e452a37e644e8194f1171b7eec1f7dc625b6526/cves/2025/67xxx/CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2025/UBUNTU-CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/Tabll/gemnasium-db/blob/de1cbf8802a4c6060caaa5924b50812f2a62fead/pypi/tornado/CVE-2025-67724.yml","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2025-67724","https://github.com/alpinelinux/aports/blob/f2436d78ccf1a868d705d0305d48ada5b79684e6/community/py3-tornado/APKBUILD","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/d880529b2028116bddf6c732baf8f599b169f01e/CVE/data/2025/CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2025-67724.json","https://github.com/Xilinx/meta-openembedded/blob/4d3e2639dec542b58708244662d5ce36810fc510/meta-python/recipes-devtools/python/python3-tornado/CVE-2025-67724.patch","https://github.com/home-assistant/buildroot/blob/dfa1d775aa4f26502c4214516050117192aeff12/package/python-tornado/python-tornado.mk"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":["https://raw.githubusercontent.com/adysec/AVE/main/pocs/2025/POC-AVE-2025-0350.toml"],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":true,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2025/AVE-2025-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2025-0106","file_name":"2025/AVE-2025-0106.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2025-55182","title":"React Server Components 反序列化远程代码执行漏洞","description":"React Server Components 的 RSC 协议存在反序列化漏洞（CWE-502），react-server-dom-parcel、react-server-dom-turbopack 与 react-server-dom-webpack 三个包未能安全校验 HTTP 请求中 Server Function 端点的载荷数据，未经身份认证的远程攻击者可发送特制的序列化请求触发该漏洞，导致远程代码执行。该漏洞影响 React 19.0.0 至 19.2.0 版本，CVSS 评分 10.0，危害等级严重。React 官方已发布修复版本 19.2.1 及更新。","severity":"CRITICAL","score":10.0,"aliases":["CVE-2025-55182"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2025-12-03T16:15:56.463","updated":"2026-06-17T09:41:24.913","remediation":"立即将 react-server-dom-webpack/react-server-dom-parcel/react-server-dom-turbopack 升级至 19.0.1、19.1.2 或 19.2.1 及以上版本。若使用 Next.js，按对应版本线升级至 14.2.35/15.0.8/15.1.12/15.2.9/15.3.9/15.4.11/15.5.10/16.0.11/16.1.5。若使用 React Router/Waku/Vite RSC 插件，同步升级 react、react-dom 及对应 RSC 包至最新版。无法立即升级时，在反向代理/WAF 层对 /_rsc 等 Server Function 端点实施访问控制或禁用 RSC 功能作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-20T00:00:00Z","references":["https://react.dev/blog/2025/12/03/critical-security-vulnerability-in-react-server-components","https://www.facebook.com/security/advisories/cve-2025-55182","http://www.openwall.com/lists/oss-security/2025/12/03/4","https://news.ycombinator.com/item?id=46136026","https://aws.amazon.com/blogs/security/china-nexus-cyber-threat-g